<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Jan-Sep load factor lower.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Jan-Sep load factor lower.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa said its seat load factor for January-September slipped 1.0 percent points from the first nine months of 1995.</p>
<p>Details for Jan-Sept were-</p>
<p>     Seat load factor (pct)	     70.4    down  1.0 pct pts</p>
<p>     Total passengers (group) (million)  31.32	up  1.4 pct</p>
<p>     Available seat kilometres (million) 87.19	up  3.3 pct</p>
<p>     Revenue seat kilometres (million)   61.40	up  1.9pct</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsdesk Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
